{"id":"b1c8fb0e112e49fa","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite.md","title":"join与normal条件重写的分层语义","display":"df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite — join与normal条件重写的分层语义","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"definition","label":"56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite","aliases":["56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite"],"display":"df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite — join与normal条件重写的分层语义","depends_on":["[[56-df-conditional-rewrite-rule]]","[[56-df-conditional-condition-semantics]]","[[56-df-signature-relative-rewrite]]","[[56-df-ground-terms]]","[[56-df-normal-form]]","[[56-df-substitution-application]]","[[56-df-position]]","[[56-df-replace]]"],"source_section":"§3.5 Definitions 3.5.3, 3.5.5","source_printed_pages":"82–84","source_statement_status":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; explicit-local-layer-construction","source_proof_status":"not-applicable"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite — join与normal条件重写的分层语义"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ae58bbf1212091b2\" href=\"?note=ae58bbf1212091b2\" title=\"56-df-conditional-rewrite-rule\">56-df-conditional-rewrite-rule</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"875e72f69ea30655\" href=\"?note=875e72f69ea30655\" title=\"56-df-conditional-condition-semantics\">56-df-conditional-condition-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d7d212169855cb94\" href=\"?note=d7d212169855cb94\" title=\"56-df-signature-relative-rewrite\">56-df-signature-relative-rewrite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"eccf433851609ffb\" href=\"?note=eccf433851609ffb\" title=\"56-df-ground-terms\">56-df-ground-terms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e295b2b3159f2b40\" href=\"?note=e295b2b3159f2b40\" title=\"56-df-normal-form\">56-df-normal-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6aa7f56f36c897f4\" href=\"?note=6aa7f56f36c897f4\" title=\"56-df-substitution-application\">56-df-substitution-application</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b58d01262349aaf3\" href=\"?note=b58d01262349aaf3\" title=\"56-df-replace\">56-df-replace</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§3.5 Definitions 3.5.3, 3.5.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"82–84"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; explicit-local-layer-construction"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 为固定签名与变量集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{CondRule}(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{CondRule}(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm u}\">\\(\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm u}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ae58bbf1212091b2\" href=\"?note=ae58bbf1212091b2\" title=\"56-df-conditional-rewrite-rule\">56-df-conditional-rewrite-rule</a>。条件列表写作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle(c_i,d_i)\\rangle_{i&lt;k}\">\\(\\langle(c_i,d_i)\\rangle_{i&lt;k}\\)</span>，下标从0开始，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=0\">\\(k=0\\)</span> 为空列表。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Red}\">\\(\\operatorname{Red}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ground}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ground}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NF}\">\\(\\mathrm{NF}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CSat}\">\\(\\mathrm{CSat}\\)</span> 和位置替换采用各直接依赖的精确签名。本节点引入谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NormalCTRS}(\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{NormalCTRS}(\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal C)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pos}(s)\">\\(\\mathrm{Pos}(s)\\)</span> 分别为替换集和项位置集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq T^2\">\\(X\\subseteq T^2\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in T\">\\(s,t\\in T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\{1,2\\}\">\\(m\\in\\{1,2\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y_{\\mathcal C,n}^{m}\">\\(Y_{\\mathcal C,n}^{m}\\)</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 递归。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"U_{\\mathcal C}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Red}(\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm u}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[U_{\\mathcal C}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Red}(\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm u}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{NormalCTRS}(\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal C)\\iff{}&amp;\n\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{CondRule}(\\Sigma,V)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall(l,r,\\langle(c_i,d_i)\\rangle_{i&lt;k})\\in\\mathcal C\\;\\forall i&lt;k\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ground}_{\\Sigma,V}(d_i)\\land\\mathrm{NF}(T,U_{\\mathcal C},d_i)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{NormalCTRS}(\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal C)\\iff{}&amp;\n\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{CondRule}(\\Sigma,V)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall(l,r,\\langle(c_i,d_i)\\rangle_{i&lt;k})\\in\\mathcal C\\;\\forall i&lt;k\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ground}_{\\Sigma,V}(d_i)\\land\\mathrm{NF}(T,U_{\\mathcal C},d_i)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Phi_{\\mathcal C}^{m}(X)\\coloneqq\\{(s,t)\\in T^2:\\;&amp;\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(l,r,\\langle(c_i,d_i)\\rangle_{i&lt;k})\\in\\mathcal C\\\\\n&amp;\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)\\;\\exists p\\in\\mathrm{Pos}(s)\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl(s|_p=l\\sigma\\land t=s[r\\sigma]_p\n\\land\\forall i&lt;k\\;\\mathrm{CSat}_{T,m}(X,c_i\\sigma,d_i\\sigma)\\bigr)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\Phi_{\\mathcal C}^{m}(X)\\coloneqq\\{(s,t)\\in T^2:\\;&amp;\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(l,r,\\langle(c_i,d_i)\\rangle_{i&lt;k})\\in\\mathcal C\\\\\n&amp;\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)\\;\\exists p\\in\\mathrm{Pos}(s)\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl(s|_p=l\\sigma\\land t=s[r\\sigma]_p\n\\land\\forall i&lt;k\\;\\mathrm{CSat}_{T,m}(X,c_i\\sigma,d_i\\sigma)\\bigr)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Y_{\\mathcal C,0}^{m}\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad\nY_{\\mathcal C,n+1}^{m}\\coloneqq\\Phi_{\\mathcal C}^{m}(Y_{\\mathcal C,n}^{m}),\\qquad\nJ_{\\mathcal C}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}Y_{\\mathcal C,n}^{1},\\qquad\nN_{\\mathcal C}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}Y_{\\mathcal C,n}^{2}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Y_{\\mathcal C,0}^{m}\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad\nY_{\\mathcal C,n+1}^{m}\\coloneqq\\Phi_{\\mathcal C}^{m}(Y_{\\mathcal C,n}^{m}),\\qquad\nJ_{\\mathcal C}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}Y_{\\mathcal C,n}^{1},\\qquad\nN_{\\mathcal C}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}Y_{\\mathcal C,n}^{2}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\to_{\\mathcal C}^{\\mathrm J}t\\iff(s,t)\\in J_{\\mathcal C},\\qquad\ns\\to_{\\mathcal C}^{\\mathrm N}t\\iff(s,t)\\in N_{\\mathcal C}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\to_{\\mathcal C}^{\\mathrm J}t\\iff(s,t)\\in J_{\\mathcal C},\\qquad\ns\\to_{\\mathcal C}^{\\mathrm N}t\\iff(s,t)\\in N_{\\mathcal C}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>已读 Definition 3.5.3 与 Definition 3.5.5（印刷第82–84页）。从空关系开始时，第1层只须条件在空关系的有限闭包中成立；因此条件两端相同的规则可以在第1层适用，并非第1层只含空条件规则。后续层通过上一层的有限归约或可汇合条件决定。两类算子都可对任意上述条件列表求值；只有NormalCTRS成立时，N才表示原书normal类。</p>\n<p>原书给normal类的递归，并指明另外两类类似；此处在一个明确接口中写出join和normal两类。有限条件列表保证有限见证性质；最小不动点论证见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0f6cdd1b3e994e97\" href=\"?note=0f6cdd1b3e994e97\" title=\"56-thm-conditional-semantics-fixed-points\">56-thm-conditional-semantics-fixed-points</a>。本文件不直接用最终关系循环定义自身。原有半等式节点保持其原接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-conditional-rewrite-rule","status":"resolved","id":"ae58bbf1212091b2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-conditional-rewrite-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-conditional-condition-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"875e72f69ea30655","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-conditional-condition-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-signature-relative-rewrite","status":"resolved","id":"d7d212169855cb94","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-signature-relative-rewrite]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-ground-terms","status":"resolved","id":"eccf433851609ffb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-ground-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"e295b2b3159f2b40","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-normal-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-application","status":"resolved","id":"6aa7f56f36c897f4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-substitution-application]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-position","status":"resolved","id":"da02033e6d596cae","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-position]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-replace","status":"resolved","id":"b58d01262349aaf3","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-replace]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-conditional-rewrite-rule","status":"resolved","id":"ae58bbf1212091b2","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})$、$V$ 为固定签名与变量集，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$，$\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{CondRule}(\\Sigma,V)$；$\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm u}$ 见 [[56-df-conditional-rewrite-rule]]。条件列表写作 $\\langle(c_i,d_i)\\rangle_{i<k}$，下标从0开始，$k=0$ 为空列表。$\\operatorname{Red}$、$\\mathrm{Ground}$、$\\mathrm{NF}$、$\\mathrm{CSat}$ 和位置替换采用各直接依赖的精确签名。本节点引入谓词 $\\mathrm{NormalCTRS}(\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal C)$。$\\mathrm{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)$ 与 $\\mathrm{Pos}(s)$ 分别为替换集和项位置集。$X\\subseteq T^2$、$s,t\\in T$、$m\\in\\{1,2\\}$；$Y_{\\mathcal C,n}^{m}$ 按 $n\\in\\mathbb N$ 递归。","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-conditional-semantics-fixed-points","status":"resolved","id":"0f6cdd1b3e994e97","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书给normal类的递归，并指明另外两类类似；此处在一个明确接口中写出join和normal两类。有限条件列表保证有限见证性质；最小不动点论证见 [[56-thm-conditional-semantics-fixed-points]]。本文件不直接用最终关系循环定义自身。原有半等式节点保持其原接口。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{CondRule}(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm u}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle(c_i,d_i)\\rangle_{i<k}","display":false},{"tex":"k=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Red}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ground}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CSat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NormalCTRS}(\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pos}(s)","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq T^2","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\{1,2\\}","display":false},{"tex":"Y_{\\mathcal C,n}^{m}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"U_{\\mathcal C}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Red}(\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm u}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{NormalCTRS}(\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal C)\\iff{}&\n\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{CondRule}(\\Sigma,V)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall(l,r,\\langle(c_i,d_i)\\rangle_{i<k})\\in\\mathcal C\\;\\forall i<k\\\\\n&\\qquad\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ground}_{\\Sigma,V}(d_i)\\land\\mathrm{NF}(T,U_{\\mathcal C},d_i)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Phi_{\\mathcal C}^{m}(X)\\coloneqq\\{(s,t)\\in T^2:\\;&\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(l,r,\\langle(c_i,d_i)\\rangle_{i<k})\\in\\mathcal C\\\\\n&\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)\\;\\exists p\\in\\mathrm{Pos}(s)\\;\\\\\n&\\bigl(s|_p=l\\sigma\\land t=s[r\\sigma]_p\n\\land\\forall i<k\\;\\mathrm{CSat}_{T,m}(X,c_i\\sigma,d_i\\sigma)\\bigr)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"Y_{\\mathcal C,0}^{m}\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad\nY_{\\mathcal C,n+1}^{m}\\coloneqq\\Phi_{\\mathcal C}^{m}(Y_{\\mathcal C,n}^{m}),\\qquad\nJ_{\\mathcal C}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}Y_{\\mathcal C,n}^{1},\\qquad\nN_{\\mathcal C}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}Y_{\\mathcal C,n}^{2}.","display":true},{"tex":"s\\to_{\\mathcal C}^{\\mathrm J}t\\iff(s,t)\\in J_{\\mathcal C},\\qquad\ns\\to_{\\mathcal C}^{\\mathrm N}t\\iff(s,t)\\in N_{\\mathcal C}.","display":true}],"bytes":3528,"backlinks":[{"id":"875e72f69ea30655","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书 Definition 3.5.3（印刷第82页）区分 semi-equational、join、normal 三类系统。前两类分别使用模式0、1；normal类还要求模式2的右端为删除条件后的无条件系统的基项正规形，该限制另见 [[56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite]]。所以这里把模式2称为定向条件，不把任意定向条件系统误称为原书的normal系统。"},{"id":"f87aa675097602ab","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf C,\\mathsf B,\\mathsf E$ 为互异函数符号，元数分别为1、0、0；$V$ 为与这些符号不交的可数无限变量集，$x\\in V$。$\\langle(a,b)\\rangle$ 表示长度1的条件列表，$\\langle\\rangle$ 为空列表。条件系统的删条件规则集、层关系和join语义采用 [[56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite]]；$\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)$、$\\mathrm{NF}(T,J,t)$、$\\mathrm{Join}(T,J,s,t)$、$\\mathrm{LocallyConfluent}(T,J)$ 和 $\\mathrm{Confluent}(T,J)$ 采用相应直接依赖的参数化接口。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-284","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite.md]]"},{"id":"0f6cdd1b3e994e97","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite]] 的 $\\Sigma,V,T,\\mathcal C,U_{\\mathcal C},\\Phi_{\\mathcal C}^{m},Y_{\\mathcal C,n}^{m}$；所有条件列表有限，$m\\in\\{1,2\\}$。$Z_m$ 为该模式各层关系的并；$\\mathcal P(T^2)$ 是关系的幂集。"},{"id":"096b350f2180027d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite]] 的全部结构，假设 $\\mathrm{NormalCTRS}(\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal C)$。模式1为可汇合条件，模式2为定向有限归约条件；两类均从空关系构造。$\\mathrm{CSat}_{T,m}(X,s,t)$、$\\mathrm{Ground}_{\\Sigma,V}(t)$ 和 $\\mathrm{NF}(T,X,t)$ 沿用该定义中的条件、基项与正规形接口。$U_{\\mathcal C}$ 为删去条件后的无条件关系。"}],"outgoing":["ae58bbf1212091b2","875e72f69ea30655","d7d212169855cb94","eccf433851609ffb","e295b2b3159f2b40","6aa7f56f36c897f4","da02033e6d596cae","b58d01262349aaf3","0f6cdd1b3e994e97"]}